# ==============================================================================
# SB Pvt. Ltd. — Enterprise Task & Workspace Management
# Root Environment Configuration Summary
# ==============================================================================
#
# This project uses modular environment configuration for backend and frontend services.
# Please configure the respective environment files before starting development:
#
# 1. Backend Service:
#    Copy server/.env.example -> server/.env
#    Configure your MySQL connection (DB_HOST, DB_PORT, DB_NAME, DB_USER, DB_PASSWORD)
#    Configure strong random JWT secrets (JWT_ACCESS_SECRET, JWT_REFRESH_SECRET)
#
# 2. Frontend Client:
#    Copy client/.env.example -> client/.env
#    Configure the API base URL (VITE_API_BASE_URL)
#
# ==============================================================================
# BACKEND (server/.env) REFERENCE:
# ==============================================================================
# NODE_ENV=development
# PORT=5000
# DB_HOST=localhost
# DB_PORT=3306
# DB_NAME=nexops
# DB_USER=root
# DB_PASSWORD=YOUR_MYSQL_PASSWORD
# JWT_ACCESS_SECRET=CHANGE_THIS_TO_A_LONG_RANDOM_ACCESS_SECRET
# JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=CHANGE_THIS_TO_A_LONG_RANDOM_REFRESH_SECRET
# CLIENT_URL=http://localhost:5173
#
# ==============================================================================
# FRONTEND (client/.env) REFERENCE:
# ==============================================================================
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
# ==============================================================================
